  "title": "Remove the lockfiles of the archived k.direct-line-token sample",
  "body": "> The archived `01.getting-started/k.direct-line-token` sample still ships `package-lock.json` files, which carry 5 Dependabot alerts.\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\n### Changed\n\n- 🏫 Samples: removed lockfiles of archived `k.direct-line-token`, and skipped it in `npm run bump`, in PR [#6025](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/6025), by [@OEvgeny](https://github.com/OEvgeny)\n\n## Description\n\nThe sample was archived in #5537, which removed its lockfiles, but `npm run bump` still ran in it and recreated them in #5659. This PR deletes both lockfiles and skips the sample in `npm run bump`, as #5533 did for `07.advanced-web-chat-apps`.\n\n## Design\n\n- Delete instead of upgrading: restify 11 already crashes the sample at startup, and fixing `zod` needs a major that `botbuilder` does not support yet.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- Deleted `k.direct-line-token/javascript/{bot,web}/package-lock.json`\n- `samples/package.json`: `bump:non-workspaces` skips `*/k.direct-line-token/*`, like `*/07.advanced-web-chat-apps/*`\n\n<!-- For bugs, add the bug repro as a test. Otherwise, add tests to futureproof your work. -->\n\n- [x] ~I have added tests and executed them locally~\n- [x] I have added `.changelog/<PR#>-<slug>.md`\n- [x] ~I have updated documentation~\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [x] ~Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)~\n- [x] ~Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed~\n- [x] ~CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)~\n- [x] ~Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)~\n- [x] ~Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)~\n- [x] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [x] ~Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)~\n- [x] ~Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)~\n",
